{
  "schema": 3,
  "id": "modern",
  "name": "Modern",
  "_source": "docs/design/06-ui-architecture.md §8.2. Left 240 (Project/Variables/Sections), centre flex (editor tabs), right 340 (Results/Graphs/Assistant, Results active). The Assistant is a TAB and is not the active one on first launch: spec §8 requires an AI panel and §39 forbids feeling like a chat app.",
  "chrome": {
    "topBar": "full",
    "statusBar": true
  },
